config BR2_PACKAGE_ROMS_HOMEBREW
	bool "roms-homebrew"
	help
	  Freely licensed homebrew games for the consoles the
	  EmulationStation frontend emulates, so a fresh image has
	  something to play. The image copies them into the user's ROM
	  folders on first boot.

	  - Game Boy Color: uCity, a city-building game (GPLv3+ code,
	    CC BY-SA 4.0 graphics and music).
	    https://github.com/AntonioND/ucity
